*.md
# ... except what `make check` READS: the doc audits (audit_limitations,
# audit_docs_budget, audit_reference_examples) need docs/ and CLAUDE.md inside
# the image, or `make docker-check` stops at the first of them and silently
# never runs the gates after it (BUG-1662). `docs/` is therefore NOT ignored.
!CLAUDE.md
# build artifacts + backups + local DBs — never COPYed by any Dockerfile, ~5GB
# of context bloat otherwise (2026-07-01)
*.vsix
vsix-out/
